								<div class="wrap container" role="document">
								<main class="main">
												       <section id="" class="marquee w-text"
  style="background-image: url(/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/pc-skyline.png);">
  <div class="row align-center align-middle">
    <div class="columns small-12">
      <h1>Amenities</h1>
      <p class="text"></p>
      <a href="tel:435-602-5400" class="button primary">
        <span class="inner">
          435-602-5400        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="overlay"></div>
</section>


<section class="fifty-split "
  id="">
  <div class="row rev align-middle">
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-2 medium-order-2 large-order-1"
      data-aos="fade-left">
      <h3></h3>
              <div class="intro">
          <p><p style="text-align: left">Experience elevated living in the <a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/ ">Black Rock Estates</a> community of Park City, Utah. From elegant and spacious home designs to exclusive community amenities and convenient access to stunning views and ski resorts, our neighborhood combines the finest aspects of everyday living with vacation-like experiences on the lake and in the mountains.</p>

    <h2 style="text-align: left">Features and Amenities</h2>
    <p style="text-align: left">Our <a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/residences/ ">custom-built homes</a> with beautiful cottage residences have been meticulously planned to embrace the natural beauty of our surroundings. Every home is designed for picture-perfect living, hosting, and recreation. Come home to stunning panoramic views and fireplaces to warm up after a day in the outdoors. Host, cook, and dine in luxury kitchens featuring Wolf stainless steel appliances, spacious granite countertops, and premium wood floors.</p>

    <p style="text-align: left">Make the outdoors part of your at-home experience with gorgeous views through the big-picture windows and slim-profile glass doors to your outdoor living spaces. Your backyard&#8217;s outdoor living space will have all the appeal and amenities of a mountain-side resort, with fire features, an outdoor kitchen, plenty of seating, and some of the best views in Utah.</p></p>
        </div>
                </div>
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-1 medium-order-1 large-order-2"
      data-aos="fade-right">
              <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/4.jpg" alt="Exterior view of Black Rock Estates Clubhouse at twilight">
          </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="fifty-split "
  id="">
  <div class="row  align-middle">
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-2 medium-order-2 large-order-1"
      data-aos="fade-right">
      <h3><h2>Community Amenities</h2></h3>
              <div class="intro">
          <p>    <p style="text-align: left">Our exclusive community also includes luxury resort-style amenities and resources for our residents. Visit the grand clubhouse, which has plenty of space for sports, recreation, dining, and hosting events at the outdoor wedding and event space. Members of our gated community also have access to these on-site facilities:</p>

    <ul style="text-align: left">
        <li><strong>Fitness center:</strong> Along with premium workout equipment, our state-of-the-art fitness center includes access to a wellness facility and luxury spa.</li>
        <li><strong>Pools:</strong> Visit our two on-site pools, outdoor waterfall feature, and hot tub.</li>
        <li><strong>Dining experiences:</strong> Residents have access to an exclusive on-site restaurant and bar.</li>
        <li><strong>Outdoor recreation spaces:</strong> Pick up a game at the on-site pickleball and <a href="https://www.olympics.com/en/news/tennis-court-markings-dimensions-size-types-variety-surface-hard-grass-clay" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">tennis courts</a>
. The pickleball courts feature stadium seating for tournaments and leagues, providing a comfortable viewing experience.</li>
        <li><strong>Kids game room:</strong> We also provide fun spaces for children—there&#8217;s something for everyone within Black Rock Estates&#8217;s luxury community amenities.</li>
        <li><strong>Event space:</strong> Perfect for hosting weddings and events, residents have access to event space for special occasions.</li>
    </ul></p>
        </div>
                </div>
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-1 medium-order-1 large-order-2"
      data-aos="fade-left">
              <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3.jpg" alt="View of Black Rock Estates Clubhouse pool">
          </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="fifty-split "
  id="">
  <div class="row rev align-middle">
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-2 medium-order-2 large-order-1"
      data-aos="fade-left">
      <h3></h3>
              <div class="intro">
          <p><h2 style="text-align: left">Local and Nearby Amenities</h2>

<p style="text-align: left">The luxury continues once you venture outside of our gated community. <a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/">Black Rock Estates</a> is conveniently located near two premium ski resorts: Park City Mountain Resort and Deer Valley Resort—perfect for avid <a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/blog/guide-to-the-best-park-city-skiing/">skiing</a>, hiking, and mountain biking enthusiasts. Park City’s world-class destination hosts events year-round and is an excellent destination for shopping and dining. <a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/residences/ ">Residents</a> of Black Rock Estates also have convenient access to the stunning Jordanelle Reservoir with the best of boating, paddleboarding, water skiing, kayaking, and more. </p>

<h2 style="text-align: left">Experience the Best of Luxury Living at Black Rock Estates</h2>
<p style="text-align: left"><a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/residences/">Every home</a> in Black Rock Estates is designed for luxury living. Within your home, you have beautiful views, top-of-the-line fixtures and appliances, and modern outdoor living spaces that make the outdoors as grand as the indoors. Residents can also conveniently walk or drive to the clubhouse, fitness center, pools, and outdoor community amenities. You&#8217;re also just a quick drive away from your favorite restaurants, ski resorts, and Utah destinations.</p></p>
        </div>
                </div>
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-1 medium-order-1 large-order-2"
      data-aos="fade-right">
              <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/4.jpg" alt="Serene landscape with a small pond">
          </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="fifty-split "
  id="">
  <div class="row  align-middle">
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-2 medium-order-2 large-order-1"
      data-aos="fade-right">
      <h3></h3>
              <div class="intro">
          <p>    <h3 style="text-align: left">Schedule a Tour or Contact Our Team for More Information</h3>

    <p style="text-align: left">Visit Black Rock Estates to envision your new luxury life. <a href="https://blackrockestatesut.com/contact-us/">Reach out today</a> by calling us at <a href="tel:4356025322">435-602-5322</a> to learn more about available homes and homesites for custom development and get a personalized community tour.</p>
</p>
        </div>
                </div>
    <div class="columns large-6 medium-12 small-12 small-order-1 medium-order-1 large-order-2"
      data-aos="fade-left">
              <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/split-img-3.png" alt="View of Black Rock Estates Clubhouse entrance in the evening">
          </div>
  </div>
</section>


